@startuml
title Sequence Diagram Masuk (Tata Usaha, Guru, Super Admin)

actor User as U
boundary View as V
control Controller as C
entity Model as M

== Login Process ==
U -> V: 1. Akses halaman masuk
V --> U: Tampilkan form login

U -> V: 2. Input kredensial dan submit
V -> C: 2.1: Handle login event

alt successful authentication
    C -> M: 2.1.1: Validate credentials
    M --> C: 2.1.2: Authentication result (valid)
    C -> M: 2.1.3: Get user data
    M --> C: 2.1.4: User data
    C -> V: 2.1.5: Update view (redirect dashboard)
    V --> U: 2.1.6: Display dashboard
    
    group Post-kondisi khusus
        alt first time login (Tata Usaha/Guru)
            C -> V: Show NIK/NUPTK form
            V --> U: Display form
            U -> V: Fill NIK/NUPTK
            V -> C: Submit form data
            C -> M: Save NIK/NUPTK
            M --> C: Data saved
            
            alt user is Guru
                C -> V: Show confirmation message
                V --> U: "Akun belum aktif, menunggu konfirmasi Tata Usaha"
            end
        end
    end
    
else authentication failure
    C -> M: 2.1.1: Validate credentials
    M --> C: 2.1.2: Authentication result (invalid)
    C -> V: 2.1.5: Update view (error message)
    V --> U: 2.1.6: Display error message
    
else validation error
    C -> V: Show validation error
    V --> U: Display error (empty fields, wrong format, etc.)
end

== Super Admin Login ==
U -> V: 1. Akses halaman admin
V --> U: Tampilkan form kode admin

U -> V: 2. Input kode admin
V -> C: 2.1: Handle admin login

alt valid admin code
    C -> M: 2.1.1: Validate admin code
    M --> C: 2.1.2: Code validation result (valid)
    C -> V: 2.1.3: Update view (redirect admin dashboard)
    V --> U: 2.1.4: Display admin dashboard
    
else invalid admin code
    C -> M: 2.1.1: Validate admin code
    M --> C: 2.1.2: Code validation result (invalid)
    C -> V: 2.1.3: Update view (error message)
    V --> U: 2.1.4: Display error "Kode tidak valid"
    
else empty code
    C -> V: Show validation error
    V --> U: Display "Wajib mengisi kode admin"
end

@enduml